Hey dear community, at the beginning I would like to welcome you all to my new contribution and hope you had a great start to the new weekend! A few days ago I organized a small giveaway for charitable purposes and in this post I would like to announce the winners.

![IMG_2412.JPG](https://files.peakd.com/file/peakd-hive/elevator09/AKJ2xysV8unpMPQmLD6d1qPTTgcfdCVAmodw7qNwAW5KgqXQNyGjtv1hp58W9XE.JPG)

The goal of the [Giveaway](https://peakd.com/blog/@elevator09/hive-charity-giveaway) was to support charitable organizations that use the Hive platform to share their work or concern and I wanted to donate the generated income of the Giveaway post which is about 5$ and in addition, I put 5 Hive for each participant into the donation fund (Maximum 100 Hive). Actually, I wanted to wait with the announcement until the payout, but I decided to end it today because there were no new participants in the last few days and I am happy that so many have participated and supported this inactive and a total of 14 Hiveans participated who not only recognized the chance of a possible prize, but also generated with their participation donations. The 14 participants have increased the donation fund to 70 Hive and with the value of the post I will not take into account the curation rewards and round up the donation amount to 100 Hive.

