Hey everyone, I hope you are all doing well and you have a weekend that has brought many interesting experiences into your life! I decided to organize a small giveaway for a good purpose and look forward to some participants.

![IMG_2316.JPG](https://files.peakd.com/file/peakd-hive/elevator09/AKNMJWqnWJFPboUrPdoER34b2iEorr3zj5otDuGW9pZjznaeWw3Z2WvtSiBbWbY.JPG)

Hive offers a great opportunity for various charitable projects to share their work and reach a community and a few days ago, I already wrote a post [here](https://peakd.com/charity/@elevator09/charity-projects-on-the-hive-blockchain) in which I tried to list all charitable projects. If someone should know more which can be found on the Hive platform, I would be happy if you could share it with me and the goal of this giveaway should be to support the work of these projects and at the same time to reward the participants. I will donate the generated income of this contribution and in addition, I will increase the donation fund per participant by 5 Hive (up to a maximum of 100 Hive) to motivate more people to participate and maybe one or the other will get to know new charitable projects which one would like to support. Participation is free of charge and even if you do not win, you can support important projects by entering and I will divide the Hive among the following accounts:

@aliento.aid
@manujune
@coldbeetrootsoup
@kbv.animalwelf
@elkezaksek
@collinz
@papilloncharity
@hive.aid
@combination
@hive.helps 

## To participate in this Giveaway:

* Upvote this post
* Write a comment with #giveaway
* Reblog this post (optionally)

## These are the prices:

* First place: 10 Hive + 1 HSBI
* Second place: 5 Hive + 1 HSBI
* Third - Sixth place: 2 Hive + 1 HSBI

**I will publish the winners after the payout of this post and use the website https://wheelofnames.com/ to give each participant the same chance to win, I created the artwork above with the help of wonder.**
